# Generated data. Excluded by rule, identified by hash.
#
# The residual dataset is the accepted V1 lineage's OOF residuals, copied here
# byte for byte by 03_freeze_spec.py so the candidate and the control are
# scored on the same rows. It is a 65 MB derived artifact of
# 02_build_oof_residuals.py; its hash and rebuild recipe are in
# ../game_latent_state/residual_manifest.json.
oof_gaussian_residuals.parquet
__pycache__/

# Regenerated exports, not inputs. factor_spec.json carries the full loadings
# payload, validation_report.json carries every summary computed from the
# grades, and paired_joint_calibration.json carries the paired comparison that
# reads them, so nothing on this branch reads either parquet. Their SHA256s are
# in SHA256SUMS.factors.txt and SHA256SUMS.validation.txt.
factor_loadings.parquet
joint_event_grades.parquet
